City Rights (Stadsrechten) - [[enkoa|Enkoa]]
- City Governments
	- A right to have a city council, named "Raad of ....", headed by the Stadholder.
	- A right to have a court of law, citizens of the city have to uphold the laws of the city.
	- A right to collect taxes, collect by the "Tolnahr"
- Privileges
	- City Walls
	- Marketright
	- Tollright, to be able to collect tolls
	- Mintright, to be able to mint coins, following the standard
	- Waagright, a right to construct and tax in weigh houses
